---
// 摄影集区块代码
---
<section class="relative w-full bg-zinc-950 overflow-hidden group">

  <a href="/gallery" class="block relative w-full h-full cursor-pointer" aria-label="查看摄影集画廊">

    <div class="relative w-full bg-black">
      <img
        src="/hero-bg.jpg"
        alt="摄影作品展示"
        class="w-full h-auto object-center block transition-transform duration-1000 transform-gpu group-hover:scale-105 opacity-95"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/10 to-transparent md:bg-none md:bg-gradient-to-b md:from-black/60 md:via-transparent md:to-black/30"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full p-6 flex items-end z-20 md:hidden pointer-events-none">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-widest drop-shadow-lg">摄影集</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col justify-start items-center text-center absolute inset-0 z-20 w-full text-white pt-[4vw] px-[4vw]" aria-hidden="true">
      <h2 class="text-[5vw] font-bold tracking-tight mb-[1vw] drop-shadow-md leading-none">
        摄影集
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[1.5vw] text-white/90 font-medium leading-relaxed drop-shadow-lg max-w-2xl">
        在这里，你可以看到山野湖海与生活方式的视觉切片。
      </p>
    </div>

  </a>
</section>